{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016115323132-1016_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261016115915\"/><p>星號為震央。</p><p>美國地質勘探局探測到，俄羅斯遠東堪察加邊疆區周五（16日）發生黎克特制6.9級地震，震源深度約143公里。日本氣象廳一度發布地震預警指千島群島發生地震，預計北海道、東北、關東甲信越、北陸、東海和伊豆群島等地將有強烈震感，地震警報約12分鐘後取消。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:19:37.908155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:53:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:40.281971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:40.281971+00:00","content_hash":"75a9f74114667621141aea44c4abee4f41fdd17414d6ad22b6ebc4908af174a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}